47,2,3,talk,George,,"@Jonathan, the fixed-fee work might cover the build.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"@George, the last rollouts show narrow tools survive better.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@May, a supplier data hub is narrow and solves a daily loss.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minato,,I agree. The data hub addresses the staffing and query issues.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
